 -m pytest\",\n    \"npm run lint\",\n    \"npm test\"\n  ],\n  \"research\": \"local-only\"\n}\n```\n\n## Board briefs\n\n### product\n\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Product management\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Define the user outcome, evidence for the change and the smallest version worth shipping.\",\n  \"routing\": [\n    \"Feature scope and outcome\",\n    \"Customer outcome\"\n  ],\n  \"expertises\": [\n    \"Product discovery and prioritization\",\n    \"User research and success metrics\",\n    \"Scope and acceptance criteria\"\n  ],\n  \"questions\": [\n    \"Who faces this problem and what do they do today?\",\n    \"What result would show the change helped them?\",\n    \"Which assumption can the team test before committing to the full scope?\"\n  ],\n  \"source_leads\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Scrum Guide\",\n      \"url\": \"https://scrumguides.org/scrum-guide.html\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### engineering\n\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Engineering\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Review code boundaries, dependencies and compatibility before choosing an implementation.\",\n  \"routing\": [\n    \"Implementation and integration\"\n  ],\n  \"expertises\": [\n    \"Software architecture and integration\",\n    \"Data modeling and migrations\",\n    \"API design and maintainability\"\n  ],\n  \"questions\": [\n    \"Which existing modules and interfaces can handle the change?\",\n    \"What happens to existing data and clients during rollout?\",\n    \"Which contracts or architecture decisions should the change document?\"\n  ],\n  \"source_leads\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenAPI Specification 3.1.2\",\n      \"url\": \"https://spec.openapis.org/oas/v3.1.2.html\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### qa\n\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Quality assurance\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Turn acceptance criteria into checks that cover the user flow and likely regressions.\",\n  \"routing\": [\n    \"Acceptance and regression checks\"\n  ],\n  \"expertises\": [\n    \"Risk-based test design\